    "title": "Eagles pull away late to beat McNairy Central - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Todd Lewis Sportswriter ,\n10 hours ago Chester County broke things open late Monday night, scoring eight runs over the final two innings to pull away for an 8-2 win over McNairy Central. For much of the night, it was a tight ball game. McNairy Central struck first with a run in the third, and the Eagles couldn’t get anything going early. That changed in a big way in the fifth. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
